### Get all images
GET http://localhost:3000/api/images

### Get one image by ID (success)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/images/69adc72668dd63050662093d

### Get one image by ID (invalid ID format)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/images/invalid-id

### Get one image by ID (non-existent ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/images/000000000000000000000000

### Rename image (success)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69adc72668dd63050662093d
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "New Image Name"
}

### Rename image (invalid ID format)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/invalid-id
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "New Name"
}

### Rename image (non-existent ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "New Name"
}

### Rename image (name too long - over 100 chars)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69adc72668dd63050662093d
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "This is a very long image name that exceeds one hundred characters which is the limit set by the API for testing purposes. This should definitely trigger the 413 error."
}

### Rename image (missing name in request body)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69adc72668dd63050662093d
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Rename image (wrong content type)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69adc72668dd63050662093d
Content-Type: text/plain

New Name